{"id": "t077-053", "text": "imogen's back op is 2 wks tmrw. 3 nights in, then 6 wks no lifting. her sister is coming down from glasgow to help w/ the kids. imogen's put a brave face on but she's terrified of the anaesthetic after last time. need to drop off some meals the wk she's home and check in on her the day after the op. also she mentioned wanting the new sally rooney so maybe get that for the hospital", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 wks tmrw", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 nights", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 wks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified of the anaesthetic", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some meals", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk she's home", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after the op", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting the new sally rooney", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get that for the hospital", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
